ost = Math.min(cost, ugliness[n - 1 - i]);\n                    }\n                    mcf.addEdge(1 + (c - 'a'), 1 + 26 + i, 1, cost);\n                }\n            }\n\n            int[] occurs = new int[128];\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i) occurs[s[i]]++;\n            for (char c = 'a'; c <= 'z'; ++c) {\n                mcf.addEdge(0, 1 + (c - 'a'), occurs[c], 0);\n            }\n\n            for (int i = 0; i < n / 2; ++i) {\n                mcf.addEdge(1 + 26 + i, 1 + 26 + n / 2, 2, 0);\n            }\n\n            long[] flow = mcf.minCostMaxFlow(0, 1 + 26 + n / 2, n);\n            out.println(-flow[0]);\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class MinCostFlow {\n        class Edge {\n            int to, rev;\n            long cap, cost;\n            Edge(int to, int rev, long cap, long cost) {\n                this.to = to;\n                this.rev = rev;\n                this.cap = cap;\n                this.cost = cost;\n            }\n        }\n\n        List<Edge>[] graph;\n        long[] potential, dist;\n        int[] prevv, preve;\n\n        @SuppressWarnings(\"unchecked\")\n        MinCostFlow(int n) {\n            graph = new List[n];\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) graph[i] = new ArrayList<>();\n            potential = new long[n];\n            dist = new long[n];\n            prevv = new int[n];\n            preve = new int[n];\n        }\n\n        void addEdge(int from, int to, long cap, long cost) {\n            graph[from].add(new Edge(to, graph[to].size(), cap, cost));\n            graph[to].add(new Edge(from, graph[from].size() - 1, 0, -cost));\n        }\n\n        long[] minCostMaxFlow(int s, int t, long maxf) {\n            long flow = 0, cost = 0;\n            Arrays.fill(potential, 0);\n            while (flow < maxf) {\n                Arrays.fill(dist, Long.MAX_VALUE);\n                dist[s] = 0;\n                PriorityQueue<long[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Comparator.comparingLong(a -> a[1]));\n                pq.offer(new long[]{s, 0});\n                while (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n                    long[] cur = pq.poll();\n                    int v = (int) cur[0];\n                    if (dist[v] < cur[1]) continue;\n                    for (int i = 0; i < graph[v].size(); i++) {\n                        Edge e = graph[v].get(i);\n                        if (e.cap > 0) {\n                            long nd = dist[v] + e.cost + potential[v] - potential[e.to];\n                            if (dist[e.to] > nd) {\n                                dist[e.to] = nd;\n                                prevv[e.to] = v;\n                                preve[e.to] = i;\n                                pq.offer(new long[]{e.to, nd});\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                if (dist[t] == Long.MAX_VALUE) break;\n                for (int v = 0; v < graph.length; v++) {\n                    if (dist[v] < Long.MAX_VALUE) potential[v] += dist[v];\n                }\n                long d = maxf - flow;\n                for (int v = t; v != s; v = prevv[v]) {\n                    d = Math.min(d, graph[prevv[v]].get(preve[v]).cap);\n                }\n                flow += d;\n                cost += d * potential[t];\n                for (int v = t; v != s; v = prevv[v]) {\n                    Edge e = graph[prevv[v]].get(preve[v]);\n                    e.cap -= d;\n                    graph[v].get(e.rev).cap += d;\n                }\n            }\n            return new long[]{cost, flow};\n        }\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\nimport heapq\n\nclass MinCostFlow:\n    class Edge:\n        def __init__(self, to, rev, cap, cost):\n            self.to = to\n            self.rev = rev\n            self.cap = cap\n            self.cost = cost\n\n    def __init__(self, n):\n        self.n = n\n        self.graph = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n        self.potential = [0] * n\n        self.dist = [0] * n\n        self.prevv = [0] * n\n        self.preve = [0] * n\n\n    def add_edge(self, fr, to, cap, cost):\n        forward = self.Edge(to, len(self.graph[to]), cap, cost)\n        backward = self.Edge(fr, len(self.graph[fr]), 0, -cost)\n        self.graph[fr].append(forward)\n        self.graph[to].append(backward)\n\n    def min_cost_max_flow(self, s, t, maxf):\n        flow = 0\n        cost = 0\n        INF = 10**18\n        while flow < maxf:\n            self.dist = [INF] * self.n\n            self.dist[s] = 0\n            pq = [(0, s)]\n            while pq:\n                d, v = heapq.heappop(pq)\n                if self.dist[v] < d:\n                    continue\n                for i, e in enumerate(self.graph[v]):\n                    if e.cap > 0:\n                        nd = self.dist[v] + e.cost + self.potential[v] - self.potential[e.to]\n                        if self.dist[e.to] > nd:\n                            self.dist[e.to] = nd\n                            self.prevv[e.to] = v\n                            self.preve[e.to] = i\n                            heapq.heappush(pq, (nd, e.to))\n            if self.dist[t] == INF:\n                break\n            for v in range(self.n):\n                if self.dist[v] < INF:\n                    self.potential[v] += self.dist[v]\n            d = maxf - flow\n            v = t\n            while v != s:\n                d = min(d, self.graph[self.prevv[v]][self.preve[v]].cap)\n                v = self.prevv[v]\n            flow += d\n            cost += d * self.potential[t]\n            v = t\n            while v != s:\n                e = self.graph[self.prevv[v]][self.preve[v]]\n                e.cap -= d\n                self.graph[v][e.rev].cap += d\n                v = self.prevv[v]\n        return [cost, flow]\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read(